## PRE-DEPLOYMENT

### Security

- [ ] **API Key Management**
  - [ ] Rate Engine API key stored in AWS Secrets Manager (not env vars)
  - [ ] Routing Service retrieves key from Secrets on first use, caches in memory
  - [ ] Rate Engine endpoint behind VPC endpoint / private ALB (not internet-facing)
  - [ ] mTLS certificates provisioned (optional but recommended)

- [ ] **Database Credentials**
  - [ ] Aurora credentials in Secrets Manager
  - [ ] Lambda IAM role has `secretsmanager:GetSecretValue` for DB secret only
  - [ ] No hardcoded credentials anywhere

- [ ] **IAM Roles & Policies**
  - [ ] Quote Lambda: SSM read-only + DynamoDB PutItem (audit table)
  - [ ] Finalize Lambda: DynamoDB GetItem + UpdateItem (Routes) + RDS connect + CloudWatch PutMetricData
  - [ ] Routing Service: DynamoDB PutItem (Routes) + Rate Engine API call + SQS send (ops queue)
  - [ ] Driver Service: DynamoDB Query (Routes) + read-only
  - [ ] Ops Service: RDS read/write (driver_payouts)

- [ ] **Encryption**
  - [ ] DynamoDB encryption at rest (AWS-managed or CMK)
  - [ ] Aurora encryption at rest (AWS-managed or CMK)
  - [ ] TLS 1.3 for all API calls
  - [ ] Secrets Manager encryption enabled

### Infrastructure

- [ ] **DynamoDB**
  - [ ] Routes table created with correct schema
  - [ ] GSI: StatusIndex, DriverIndex, DateIndex
  - [ ] TTL enabled on `expiresAt` field
  - [ ] On-demand billing mode (or provisioned with autoscaling)
  - [ ] Point-in-time recovery enabled
  - [ ] Backups scheduled (daily)

- [ ] **Aurora PostgreSQL**
  - [ ] `driver_payouts` table created with correct schema
  - [ ] Indexes: driver_id + created_at, status, variance_pct, finalized_at
  - [ ] Read replicas in af-south-1 (for DR)
  - [ ] Automated backups (7 days retention)
  - [ ] Enhanced monitoring enabled
  - [ ] Encryption at rest

- [ ] **Lambda Functions**
  - [ ] Quote handler deployed to `afroogo-rate-engine-quote`
  - [ ] Finalize handler deployed to `afroogo-rate-engine-finalize`
  - [ ] Memory: 512 MB (sufficient for JSON parsing + DB calls)
  - [ ] Timeout: 30s (quote), 60s (finalize)
  - [ ] Ephemeral storage: default (512 MB)
  - [ ] VPC: connect if private endpoint required
  - [ ] Environment variables set (ROUTES_TABLE_NAME, DB_SECRET_ARN, etc.)
  - [ ] Reserved concurrency: 100 (to prevent throttling)

- [ ] **SSM Parameter Store**
  - [ ] `/afrogo/rate-engine/base-rate-zar` = `30. 00`
  - [ ] `/afrogo/rate-engine/km-factor-zar` = `0. 125`
  - [ ] All other config parameters loaded
  - [ ] Parameter policy: Ops team read-only, CTO write
  - [ ] Change notifications: SNS topic for config updates

- [ ] **API Gateway (internal)**
  - [ ] VPC endpoint configured (if using private ALB)
  - [ ] Authorizer: IAM (for service-to-service) or custom Lambda
  - [ ] Throttling: 1000 req/min per API key
  - [ ] CORS: restricted to internal origins only
  - [ ] Logging: CloudWatch logs enabled
  - [ ] X-Ray tracing enabled

- [ ] **CloudWatch**
  - [ ] Log groups created: `/aws/lambda/afroogo-rate-engine-*`
  - [ ] Log retention: 30 days
  - [ ] Metric alarms:
