## DEPLOYMENT

### Stage 1: Staging Environment

- [ ] Deploy to `afroogo-staging` VPC
- [ ] Run smoke tests (Routing → quote → Routes → finalize)
- [ ] Load test: 100 RPS for 5 minutes
- [ ] Verify metrics & alarms firing correctly
- [ ] Verify Secrets Manager access works
- [ ] Run 24-hour soak test
- [ ] **Sign-off: CTO + DevOps**

### Stage 2: Production Canary (10% traffic)

- [ ] Deploy to `afroogo-production` VPC
- [ ] Use API Gateway canary deployment (10% traffic to new version)
- [ ] Monitor for errors, latency, variance anomalies
- [ ] Duration: 1 hour minimum
- [ ] Rollback procedure ready
- [ ] **Sign-off: CTO + Ops**

### Stage 3: Production Full (100% traffic)

- [ ] Promote canary to 100% if no errors
- [ ] Monitor for 4 hours continuously
- [ ] Alert: email CTO + on-call if any anomalies
- [ ] **Sign-off: CTO**

### Post-Deployment

- [ ] Verify all metrics populated (CloudWatch dashboard live)
- [ ] First route quoted successfully
- [ ] First payout finalized successfully
- [ ] Variance evaluation working (review a few in Ops dashboard)
- [ ] Driver app showing earnings correctly
- [ ] Finance team verifying ledger entries
- [ ] **Sign-off: CTO + CFO + Ops Lead**

